C.3 Federation Protocol

Act Interchange Format (JSON-LD + PROV-O):

```json
{
  "@context": "https://www.w3.org/ns/prov",
  "@type": "prov:Activity",
  "subtype": "Assert",
  "id": "sha256:...",
  "producer": "did:web:instance.example",
