Appendix G: What HKR Explicitly Does Not Claim

\mathrm{HKR} \neq \text{all human knowledge}

\mathrm{HKR} \neq \text{truth}

\mathrm{HKR} \neq \text{consensus}

\mathrm{HKR} \neq \text{oracle}

The HKR claims only to be:

\boxed{
\text{persistent} + \text{versioned} + \text{provenance-aware} + \text{evidence-linked} + \text{conflict-preserving}
}

It is an audit apparatus, not an authority. Its value lies in what it makes impossible to say without evidence: nothing more, nothing less.

